<title>ALBANIA: Thousands at funeral of Albanian riot victim.</title>
<headline>Thousands at funeral of Albanian riot victim.</headline>
<dateline>VLORE, Albania 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thousands of mourners, clapping in unison and shouting &quot;the police killed him&quot;, filed through the Albanian port of Vlore on Tuesday at the funeral of an anti-government demonstrator killed in clashes with police.</p>
<p>As the marchers passed through the streets behind the open coffin, the headquarters of President Sali Berisha's Democratic Party was seen to be engulfed in flames.</p>
</text>
